Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.11,0:17:44.54,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}哇！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:43.11,0:17:44.54,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Wow!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:44.88,0:17:49.80,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}我有點糾結 但最後還是選了日本的傳統食物
Dialogue: 8,0:17:44.88,0:17:49.80,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ちょっといろいろ 悩み過ぎちゃって 日本の伝統食にしてみたんだけど
Dialogue: 9,0:17:50.72,0:17:53.26,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}跟水果一樣 看起來就很美味！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:50.72,0:17:53.26,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Looks delicious! Like a fruit!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:53.81,0:17:55.02,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}啊…
Dialogue: 8,0:17:53.81,0:17:55.02,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あぁ…
Dialogue: 9,0:17:55.73,0:17:59.56,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}太 太好了…{\fscx50} {\fscx100}看來她很開心
Dialogue: 8,0:17:55.73,0:17:59.56,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}よ よかった… 喜んでもらえたみたい
Dialogue: 9,0:18:00.01,0:18:01.18,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}這邊的是？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:00.01,0:18:01.18,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}こっちは～？
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.14,0:18:05.02,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}哦 馬麥醬…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:02.14,0:18:05.02,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}おぉ～ マーマイト…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.53,0:18:11.06,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}這是我第一次送外國朋友禮物 一不小心就想得太多了
Dialogue: 8,0:18:05.53,0:18:11.06,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}外国の友達に プレゼント贈るの初めてで 私も考え過ぎちゃって
Dialogue: 9,0:18:11.34,0:18:14.45,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}就覺得熟悉的食物會不會比較好呢
Dialogue: 8,0:18:11.34,0:18:14.45,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}親しみやすい食べ物なら どうかな～って
Dialogue: 9,0:18:14.90,0:18:17.33,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}謝謝！我非常開心！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:14.90,0:18:17.33,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ありがとう！ とってもうれしい！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.95,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}太 太好了…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.95,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}よ よかったぁ…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:20.29,0:18:24.43,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}啊 莉莉 我也可以送你生日禮物嗎
Dialogue: 8,0:18:20.29,0:18:24.43,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あっ リリーちゃん  俺からも 誕生日プレゼント渡してもいいかな
Dialogue: 9,0:18:24.62,0:18:25.27,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}嗯！？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:24.62,0:18:25.27,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}はっ！？
Dialogue: 9,0:18:37.19,0:18:40.60,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}希望你會喜歡這條手帕…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:37.19,0:18:40.60,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ハンカチ 気に入ってもらえるといいんだけど…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:40.98,0:18:43.65,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}是遊戲廳限定款！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:40.98,0:18:43.65,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}The one limited to amusement arcades!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:44.39,0:18:47.48,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}哇 真厲害！你一眼就認出來了！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:44.39,0:18:47.48,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}うお！？ さすが！ 一瞬でわかるんだ！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:50.03,0:18:53.03,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}我會一直珍惜它的 謝謝你 蓮司
Dialogue: 8,0:18:50.03,0:18:53.03,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}I'll always take good care of it! Thanks, Renji!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:53.77,0:18:57.74,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}居然不怕重複 選了男子氣概無尾熊周邊來當禮物
Dialogue: 8,0:18:53.77,0:18:57.74,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}かぶりを恐れずに 漢気コアラグッズを選ぶなんて
Dialogue: 9,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.58,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}他是掌握了莉莉擁有的所有周邊的資訊嗎！？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.58,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}リリーちゃんの所有グッズを 把握してるの！？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:00.85,0:19:04.25,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}蓮司先生 你們兩個到底是什麼關係…！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:00.85,0:19:04.25,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}蓮司さん いったいどういう関係なの…！
Dialogue: 9,0:19:16.01,0:19:21.09,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}總覺得就我們自己玩得這麼開心 有點對不起莉莉爸爸呢
Dialogue: 8,0:19:16.01,0:19:21.09,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}なんだか アタシたちだけ 楽しんじゃって お父さんに申し訳ないですね
Dialogue: 9,0:19:21.09,0:19:26.40,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}沒關係沒關係 有他在的話會鬧得特別開心 根本控制不住局面
Dialogue: 8,0:19:21.09,0:19:26.40,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}いいのいいの あの人がいると すごい大はしゃぎで 収拾つかなくなっちゃうし
Dialogue: 9,0:19:26.95,0:19:31.44,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}孩子他爸今年也為了生日準備了服裝之類的哦
Dialogue: 8,0:19:26.95,0:19:31.44,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あの人 今年も誕生日のために 衣装とか準備してるのよ
Dialogue: 9,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.42,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}服裝？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.42,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}衣裝？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:33.26,0:19:33.90,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}啊…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:33.26,0:19:33.90,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あっ…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.03,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}怎麼了？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.03,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}どうかしました？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:36.53,0:19:41.79,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}不對…{\fscx50} {\fscx100}我好像跟爸爸說錯家庭生日會的日子了…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:36.53,0:19:41.79,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}いヤ… パパに家族で祝う日 間違えて伝えちゃってたかも…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.45,0:19:48.13,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}嘿呀！爹地我提前做完事趕回來了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:43.45,0:19:48.13,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Heeey! Daddy finished work early and came home!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:55.51,0:19:58.25,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}抱歉 我下次再來…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:55.51,0:19:58.25,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}すまない また来るよ…
Dialogue: 9,0:20:00.24,0:20:02.35,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}為什麼你這傢伙會在這裡～！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:00.24,0:20:02.35,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}なぜ貴様がここにいる～！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.35,0:20:03.31,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}欸！？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:02.35,0:20:03.31,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}えぇ！？
Dialogue: 9,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.49,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}而且還穿同樣的衣服！？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.49,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}しかも同じ格好を！？
Dialogue: 9,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.37,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}但我扮的無尾熊更加高貴美麗！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.37,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}だが私のコアラのほうが 気高く美しい！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:08.37,0:20:09.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}對吧 莉莉！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:08.37,0:20:09.81,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}そうだろう リリー！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:10.41,0:20:12.67,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}蓮司 看這邊 茄子！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:10.41,0:20:12.67,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}レンジ はいチーズ！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:13.33,0:20:14.87,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}唔唔…
Dialogue: 8,0:20:13.33,0:20:14.87,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}んんっ…
Dialogue: 9,0:20:21.27,0:20:22.91,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}你這傢伙～！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:21.27,0:20:22.91,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}貴様～！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:22.91,0:20:24.33,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}欸～！？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:22.91,0:20:24.33,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}えぇ～！？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.08,0:21:07.37,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}媽媽～！我想吃禮物裡那個紅色的東西！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:04.08,0:21:07.37,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ママー！ プレゼントでもらった 赤いの食べたい！
Dialogue: 9,0:21:07.62,0:21:08.69,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}好啊～
Dialogue: 8,0:21:07.62,0:21:08.69,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}いいわよ～
Dialogue: 9,0:21:10.66,0:21:11.37,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}是這個？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:10.66,0:21:11.37,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}これ？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:30.88,0:21:33.52,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}啊 那是莉莉收到的那個吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:30.88,0:21:33.52,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}あっ それ リリーちゃんがもらってたやつ？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:33.95,0:21:38.05,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}嗯 我前幾天看到了有點在意就買來試試
Dialogue: 8,0:21:33.95,0:21:38.05,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}ああ こないだ見つけて 気になったから買ってみたんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.21,0:21:45.18,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}好鹹！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:44.21,0:21:45.18,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}しょっぱっ！
Dialogue: 9,0:21:45.18,0:21:46.91,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}怎麼這麼酸！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:45.18,0:21:46.91,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}How sour!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:49.89,0:21:52.75,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}為什麼會有人在吃這種東西呢
Dialogue: 8,0:21:49.89,0:21:52.75,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}なんで こんなものを 食べてるんだろう
Dialogue: 9,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.10,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}嗚～！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.10,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}うぅ～っ！
